  "title": "Dusky warbler",
  "extract": "The dusky warbler is a leaf warbler which breeds in the east Palearctic. The genus name Phylloscopus is from Ancient Greek phullon, \"leaf\", and skopos, \"seeker\". The specific fuscatus is from Latin fuscus \"dark\".",
